# Heading on DemoPage

## Source of truth
- Every demo is a **copy-paste from a real project usage**.
- **Text**: same `t('…')` keys or hardcoded strings the page uses. No invented `demo.heading.*` samples.
- One `ShowCodeToggle` per **visually distinct** style.

## Distinct only
- Keep **one sample per look**: different color, weight, size token, or chrome (e.g. border + View All count).
- Do **not** stack near-duplicates (e.g. multiple `#667085` section titles, multiple white home titles, AuthHeading h2 + h4).

## Colors & chrome
- Exact project colors (including `text-white`). No `!text-black`, no demo background boxes.
- If the real usage has adjacent chrome, include that markup: profile tab count / View All, and PlanDetail free-tokens title with `BaseTooltip`. Do not invent a `leftIcon` on `Heading`.

## Do not demo
- Unused named themes (`formHeading`, `orderHeading`, `dashboardHeading`, etc.).
- `homeDitchTitleXl` / near-identical white section titles (`homeSafetyTitle`, `homeOverviewTitle` when same look as ditch/hero family already covered).
- Fake `leftIcon` samples.
